<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12551] Partition desync if a partition is evicted then owned again and historically rebalanced</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12551</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Where is a possibility of partition desync in the following scenario:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1. Some partition is evicted with non zero counters.&lt;br/&gt;
2. It is owned again and are going to be rebalanced.&lt;br/&gt;
3. Some node in a grid has history for the partition defined by it&apos;s (initial, current) counters pair.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In this scenario the partition will be historically rebalanced having only partial data.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
